<https://threadbiz.ai/journey/neighborhood-table-001/entry-012> <https://threadbiz.ai/ontology#caption> "This week's menu brings together a few cherished connections and ingredients! We're making dumplings in a broth crafted from last week's saved chicken bones, with carrots and fresh parsley from Rosa's farm stand. It’s all seasoned with dried basil from Week One, and we're so glad Dave's daughter asked for dumplings! Please pre-order for this week's drop." .
